ue only. Represents value unknown in this version.","This campaign serves vehicle ads."]},name:{type:"string",description:"The name of the campaign. This field is required and should not be empty when creating new campaigns. It must not contain any null (code point 0x0), NL line feed (code point 0xA) or carriage return (code point 0xD) characters."},hotelSetting:{$ref:"GoogleAdsGoogleadsV25Resources_Campaign_HotelSettingInfo",description:"The hotel setting for the campaign."},percentCpc:{description:"Standard Percent Cpc bidding strategy where bids are a fraction of the advertised price for some good or service.",$ref:"GoogleAdsGoogleadsV25Common__PercentCpc"},videoCampaignSettings:{description:"Settings for Video campaign.",$ref:"GoogleAdsGoogleadsV25Resources_Campaign_VideoCampaignSettings"},targetingSetting:{description:"Setting for targeting related features.",$ref:"GoogleAdsGoogleadsV25Common__TargetingSetting"},missingEuPoliticalAdvertisingDeclaration:{type:"boolean",readOnly:!0,description:"Output only. Indicates whether this campaign is missing a declaration about whether it contains political advertising targeted towards the EU and is ineligible for any exemptions. If this field is true, use the contains_eu_political_advertising field to add the required declaration. This field is read-only."},hotelPropertyAssetSet:{type:"string",description:"Immutable. The resource name for a set of hotel properties for Performance Max for travel goals campaigns."}},id:"GoogleAdsGoogleadsV25Resources__Campaign",description:"A campaign."},GoogleAdsGoogleadsV25Resources_ConversionAction_GoogleAnalytics4Settings:{id:"GoogleAdsGoogleadsV25Resources_ConversionAction_GoogleAnalytics4Settings",type:"object",properties:{propertyId:{readOnly:!0,format:"int64",description:"Output only. The ID of the GA 4 property.",type:"string"},eventName:{type:"string",description:"Output only. The name of the GA 4 event.",readOnly:!0},propertyName:{readOnly:!0,type:"string",description:"Output on