scribes the user's interests or actions.",type:"string"},memberType:{type:"string",enumDescriptions:["Not specified.","Used for return value only. Represents value unknown in this version.","Users whose interests or actions are described by a keyword.","Users who have interests related to the website's content.","Users who visit place types described by a place category.","Users who have installed a mobile app."],enum:["UNSPECIFIED","UNKNOWN","KEYWORD","URL","PLACE_CATEGORY","APP"],description:"The type of custom audience member, KEYWORD, URL, PLACE_CATEGORY or APP."},url:{type:"string",description:"An HTTP URL, protocol-included — at most 2048 characters, which includes contents users have interests in."},placeCategory:{type:"string",description:"A place type described by a place category users visit.",format:"int64"},app:{type:"string",description:"A package name of Android apps which users installed such as com.google.example."}},id:"GoogleAdsGoogleadsV25Resources__CustomAudienceMember",description:"A member of custom audience. A member can be a KEYWORD, URL, PLACE_CATEGORY or APP. It can only be created or removed but not changed."},GoogleAdsGoogleadsV25Common__PlacementListInfo:{description:"A Placement List criterion. Represents a shared set of placements that can be excluded at the account-level.",properties:{sharedSet:{description:"The PlacementListInfo shared set resource name.",type:"string"}},type:"object",id:"GoogleAdsGoogleadsV25Common__PlacementListInfo"},GoogleAdsGoogleadsV25Resources__Customer:{properties:{finalUrlSuffix:{description:"The URL template for appending params to the final URL. Only mutable in an `update` operation.",type:"string"},payPerConversionEligibilityFailureReasons:{description:"Output only. Reasons why the customer is not eligible to use PaymentMode.CONVERSIONS. If the list is empty, the customer is eligible. This field is read-only.",items:{enumDescriptions:["Not specified.","Used for return value only. Represents value unknown 